09:08.000 --> 09:12.000
First, we'd put an old 12 inch
LP.

09:12.000 --> 09:14.000
We put that on the turn table.

09:14.000 --> 09:16.000
And then we'd put a, we call a
slip mat,

09:16.000 --> 09:18.000
which is like a velvet
anti-static mat,

09:18.000 --> 09:19.000
but an oversized one.

09:19.000 --> 09:22.000
So we'd cut it out of velvet
ourselves.

09:22.000 --> 09:24.000
And it would be anti-static as
