09:24.000 --> 09:26.000
So that if you grab that mat,

09:26.000 --> 09:30.000
then basically the record that
would sit on top of that,

09:30.000 --> 09:32.000
would not play.

09:32.000 --> 09:35.000
But underneath the turn table
was still turning.

09:35.000 --> 09:37.000
Now granted a little bit slower
than, you know,

09:37.000 --> 09:39.000
the desired revolutions per
minute.

09:39.000 --> 09:41.000
