hinge.

10:23.000 --> 10:24.000
And it goes click.

10:24.000 --> 10:27.000
And that can, of course, in turn
create a circuit.

10:27.000 --> 10:29.000
But we weren't using that for
the circuit part of the

10:29.000 --> 10:31.000
